{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 能力仲裁｜流程子图\n只画申请到激活/拒绝的先后。类与接口见 [[GGYGO_结构_AbilitySystem.canvas|结构图]]；[[计划_AbilitySystem]]。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1660,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "request",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. InputTag 或 ActionTag 形成能力激活请求。\n\n玩家经 ProcessAbilityInput 收集 SpecHandle；Boss 经 ActionTag 定位 SpecHandle，两者最终进 ASC::TryActivateAbility。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "tag",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. ASC 检查基础激活条件和 Tag 关系映射。\n\nASC::CanActivateAbilityByHandle（AI 预检）/ GA::CanActivateAbility（实际准入）检查 Tag、成本与 Mapping；返回 FailureTags。",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "group",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. ASC 按组规则、Exclusive 策略和优先级仲裁；同级按 D4。\n\nGA::CanActivateAbility → ASC::IsActivationBlockedByGroup(Ability, OutReason)；读取 GroupConfig 和 ActiveAbilitiesByGroup。",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "allow",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4A. 允许：取消被压制实例，登记新能力所在组并激活 GA。\n\nASC::NotifyAbilityActivated → AddAbilityToActivationGroup；冲突旧实例按规则取消，随后 GA::ActivateAbility。",
      "x": 1430,
      "y": 216,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "reject",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4B. 拒绝：回传原因；可重试的玩家意图由 HeroComponent 缓冲。\n\nASC::NotifyAbilityFailed(Handle, Ability, FailureReason)；仅 Queued 原因触发 OnAbilityInputRetryable(Tag)。",
      "x": 1430,
      "y": 675,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "freed",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. 旧 GA 结束释放组；HeroComponent 收到通知再申请一次。\n\nGA::EndAbility → ASC::RemoveAbilityFromActivationGroup → OnAbilityGroupFreed.Broadcast(GroupTag) → HeroComponent::HandleAbilityGroupFreed。",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 824,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "request",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "tag",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "提交请求"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "tag",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "group",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "基础条件通过"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "group",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "allow",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "允许 / 可中断"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "group",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "reject",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "阻断 / 占组"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "fromNode": "reject",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "freed",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "可重试"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "fromNode": "freed",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "request",
      "toSide": "bottom",
      "label": "重新申请"
    }
  ]
}
